  ('CBCC', 'CBCC', 'Cross-Border Correspondent Banking', 'Correspondent chains, nostro funding, FX, sanctions screening and gpi-style tracking on SWIFT CBPR+ (ISO 20022 pacs.008 / pacs.009 / pacs.004).', 'CBCC — Cross-Border Correspondent Banking', 'correspondent'),
